# Always ship Retro

After any meaningful change in this repo:

1. Commit with the user's git identity (env vars only, never `git config`).
2. Push to `origin` / `main`.
3. GitHub Pages deploys from that push via `.github/workflows/pages.yml`.

Do not wait to be asked. Local `localhost:3003` is for checking; the live site is https://koundinyapidaparthydev.github.io/Retro/
